{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"valid\":true,\"entry\":\"左上方第一组带紫色竖线的大号白色文字，首先落在“明知道回去未必找得回那份亲近，他却还是忍不住想：万一能呢？”；随后下方绿色大字也很容易进入视线。\",\"grasp_who\":\"一个仍然对过去的亲近关系抱有期待、但不愿再回到从前忍让生活的人，正在犹豫是否回头。\",\"grasp_feel\":\"不舍、期待、犹豫、戒备。\",\"missed\":\"他已经倾向于暂时不急着回去，而是先把眼下的日子过稳；虽然仍害怕以后遇到困难只能独自承担，但不想因此放弃刚刚做出的打算。\",\"burden\":[\"几块同样显眼的字争夺主视线，顶部紫色文字和下方两组绿色大字都具有较强视觉权重。\",\"核心意思分散在几块里，要拼起来才懂：上方讲回头的期待与顾虑，中间讲先稳定当下，底部讲仍有恐惧但不再退缩。\",\"单块较长，包含好几层意思，不能只扫到开头就完整判断人物此刻的处境和感受。\"],\"score\":2}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "46875253-3d76-449f-8f13-0f10281a432b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T032417862321Z", "elapsed_seconds": 17.703, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T03:24:35.569778+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "b28b73cd075bdf5fdb6d5aa0faa0ead8881863d990525752d012863a0fa5ff9d", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatg